# Line endings are load-bearing in this workspace, so they are pinned rather
# than left to each developer's core.autocrlf. A CRLF .sh baked into the WSL
# image corrupts every variable it exports -- that is a real defect this project
# has already had to diagnose once.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.sh  text eol=lf
